WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.625
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:51.500
how because of yoga's meritorious deeds,

3
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:52.250
a yogi

4
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.333
is born in the next life also

5
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.541
in such a family

6
00:00:55.541 --> 00:00:56.333
where there's

7
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.208
a suitable environment

8
00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:00.458
for their spiritual progress.

9
00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.000
Now here, Lord Krishna

10
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.208
is shedding light on that yogi's spiritual progress

11
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.375
in the new birth.

12
00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:15.083
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

13
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.250
that because of meritorious deeds, the yogi

14
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.083
is born in the next life

15
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.500
in some religious or

16
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.375
prosperous family.

17
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.916
Now in this forty-third verse of the sixth chapter,

18
00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:28.250
Lord Krishna explains that the yogi

19
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.625
who is born in such a family

20
00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:31.500
again connects

21
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.208
with that spiritual conduct

22
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.208
and knowledge

23
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:38.416
which they had obtained in the previous birth.

24
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:41.708
Lord Krishna calls this buddhi-saṁyogam,

25
00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:42.875
meaning the regaining of

26
00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:45.625
intellect or consciousness.

27
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:49.083
This is not new knowledge,
 but the flow of knowledge obtained

28
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:52.333
from the practice of the previous birth.

29
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.041
When the practice of the previous life

30
00:01:54.041 --> 00:01:57.125
is left incomplete, it doesn't end,

31
00:01:57.125 --> 00:01:58.291
but in the new life

32
00:01:58.291 --> 00:01:59.333
that same journey

33
00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:03.125
starts again from where it had stopped.

34
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:05.166
Yatate ca tato bhūyaḥ –

35
00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:06.666
meaning that yogi,

36
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.208
once again with new enthusiasm,

37
00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:14.166
advances on their incomplete spiritual journey.

38
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:17.041
And when, inspired by the spiritual
 knowledge of previous life,

39
00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:20.541
that yogi again makes effort,

40
00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:23.333
keeps firm resolve, then
 they can reach near saṁsiddhi,

41
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:27.083
meaning complete perfection.

42
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:30.000
Then in the forty-fourth verse,
 Lord Krishna explains

43
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.250
that because of that yogi's

44
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.041
practice of previous birth,

45
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:35.750
the path of yoga

46
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.791
naturally attracts them.

47
00:02:37.791 --> 00:02:40.500
This attraction is so powerful

48
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.500
that whether that person recognizes it or not,

49
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:49.291
inside them there's already
 a strong desire to adopt spirituality.

50
00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:52.583
And as a result of this strong desire, that yogi

51
00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:58.166
starts rising above the karma
 kāṇḍas written in scriptures

52
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.666
related to material success, wealth, profit, etc.

53
00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:02.125
Meaning their attraction

54
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:04.583
doesn't go to topics

55
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.333
related to material success written in scriptures.

56
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:13.875
Their mind only goes toward spirituality
 related to self-realization and liberation.

57
00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:17.208
This happens because the
 saṁskāras of previous birth

58
00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:20.125
still remain with that soul.

59
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.875
And these saṁskāras take them
 beyond worldly attractions,

60
00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:25.916
toward the supreme truth.

61
00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:28.375
That person shows interest
 not in material pleasures,

62
00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:30.291
but in understanding their soul

63
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:34.416
and attaining Paramātmā.

64
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:36.541
But one very important thing –

65
00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:39.958
even though this interest in spirituality

66
00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:43.916
is already hidden in that yogi, but in the new life,

67
00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:48.000
all efforts to walk on this 
journey must be done by them.

68
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.208
Only through efforts will the knowledge
 of their previous birth emerge.

69
00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:54.791
All this won't happen automatically.

70
00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.958
Even a yogi born in a religious

71
00:04:00.958 --> 00:04:03.833
and prosperous family

72
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:12.000
only gets the foundation of spirituality
 from the previous birth.

73
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.583
There's definitely a seed of inspiration in them.

74
00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:21.166
But they must water this seed.

75
00:04:21.166 --> 00:04:24.416
They must now make all efforts

76
00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:28.916
to take the spiritual journey forward.

77
00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:31.916
Nothing will happen automatically.

78
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:33.125
Similarly,

79
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:38.500
even if you have some special talent from birth,

80
00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.250
it’s only a seed,

81
00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.375
a beginning.

82
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:46.041
Progress in this journey

83
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:50.333
will only and only happen through your efforts.

84
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:53.041
If that talent isn't used,

85
00:04:53.041 --> 00:04:57.166
if it isn't made excellent through practice,

86
00:04:57.166 --> 00:05:00.958
then success won't be possible.

87
00:05:00.958 --> 00:05:04.875
Whatever talent is inside you,

88
00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:08.333
without hard work it won't bear fruit.

89
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:09.750
For example,

90
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.250
even after a singer has a very sweet voice,

91
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.625
they must do continuous practice and training.

92
00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:23.458
If practice isn't done, then the sweetness 
of the voice will start decreasing,

93
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:28.333
and they can never reach that peak of success

94
00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:31.916
where they had the capability to reach.

95
00:05:31.916 --> 00:05:35.375
This rule is appropriate in every field.

96
00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:39.000
An intelligent student only succeeds

97
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.000
when they study continuously.

98
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.958
A skilled runner can also maintain their speed

99
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:49.291
only when they practice constantly.

100
00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:51.125
Getting facilities in life

101
00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:53.125
or having natural talent

102
00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:56.666
is definitely a good start, but

103
00:05:56.666 --> 00:05:59.291
only hard work and dedication

104
00:05:59.291 --> 00:06:02.625
will take you to the peak of success.

105
00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.166
Sometimes in the family we see

106
00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:16.958
that some children don't show interest
 in traditional customs or religious rituals.

107
00:06:16.958 --> 00:06:23.208
Rather, they mock these and raise many
 questions about these religious rituals.

108
00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:31.791
Many times when they say all this is useless,
 family elders consider it disrespect.

109
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:38.750
If they start asking questions related to soul,
 Paramātmā, purpose of life, etc.,

110
00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:39.958
then many times elders

111
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:43.708
cannot answer these questions.

112
00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:51.791
Such children are blamed for
 being arrogant, or rebellious and rude.

113
00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:54.000
But remember,

114
00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.625
it's possible

115
00:06:55.625 --> 00:06:59.625
these signs are not of arrogance or rebellion,

116
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:01.666
but of their

117
00:07:01.666 --> 00:07:05.416
excellent spiritual state.

118
00:07:05.416 --> 00:07:07.916
As I said, in every soul

119
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:11.750
saṁskāras of previous birth remain.

120
00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.041
And a yogi, after rebirth,

121
00:07:15.041 --> 00:07:17.875
many times automatically

122
00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:21.500
starts getting inspired toward spirituality

123
00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:26.333
and topics of the soul,
 rising above materialism and customs.

124
00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:28.708
Spirituality is not limited

125
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:31.083
only to religious rituals.

126
00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:35.125
Spirituality also brings forth deep questions

127
00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:38.333
of soul and Paramātmā.

128
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:40.541
So it's necessary that these children's

129
00:07:40.541 --> 00:07:44.458
curiosity be understood, be resolved.

130
00:07:44.458 --> 00:07:46.916
Instead of rejecting their questions,

131
00:07:46.916 --> 00:07:50.041
answers should be given.

132
00:07:50.041 --> 00:07:56.458
Guide them with love and sensitivity.

133
00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:58.500
By doing this, either

134
00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.166
respect for religion will grow

135
00:08:02.166 --> 00:08:06.041
or by finding answers to 
 their questions, not only their,

136
00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:10.375
but your spiritual progress will also happen.

137
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:17.083
Many times those people who externally
 don't show interest in religious activities, 

138
00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:23.208
inside them a deep spiritual
 inspiration is awakening.

139
00:08:23.208 --> 00:08:27.500
This can only be recognized
 with the right perspective.

140
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:39.833
A yogi gets the foundation of the previous
 birth's spiritual journey in the new birth too.

141
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:41.250
But this foundation

142
00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.583
is received only in the form
 of inspiration or interest.

143
00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:48.750
Now on this foundation, 
efforts must be made by them,

144
00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.541
otherwise spiritual progress isn't possible.

145
00:08:52.541 --> 00:08:55.416
Similarly, in professional life too,

146
00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:59.250
only natural talent is not enough.

147
00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.250
If this talent isn't polished,

148
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.750
then it will disappear and

149
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:12.791
only having interest or inspiration toward
 some subject isn't an assurance of success.

150
00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:16.458
You'll find many people

151
00:09:16.458 --> 00:09:19.375
who, being inspired, do start something,

152
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:23.041
but soon give up and stop.

153
00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:26.083
On the other hand, some people,
 after a little progress,

154
00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:27.916
think that just

155
00:09:27.916 --> 00:09:30.541
now hard work isn't needed.

156
00:09:30.541 --> 00:09:34.791
So remember, firm resolve, continuous practice,

157
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:40.166
and without hard work,
 success won't be achieved.

158
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:42.625
Having talent or interest in you

159
00:09:42.625 --> 00:09:46.375
is my signal that this is your life's path.

160
00:09:46.375 --> 00:09:48.208
But

161
00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:52.041
this is only direction.

162
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:56.250
Now walking on this path must be done by you.

163
00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.333
Remember,

164
00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:02.000
I am standing to help you,

165
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.666
but you too must take some steps toward me.

166
00:10:06.666 --> 00:10:10.166
And these steps are steps of hard work.

167
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:12.916
Steps of resolve.

168
00:10:12.916 --> 00:10:16.500
A singer takes these steps
 through daily practice.

169
00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:20.500
An employee takes these
 steps through their diligence.

170
00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.833
A scientist

171
00:10:21.833 --> 00:10:25.375
takes a step through regular research.

172
00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:26.916
So you too

173
00:10:26.916 --> 00:10:29.750
must work hard in your field.

174
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.166
Then see, success

175
00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:35.166
and my help both will be received.
